    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of Mike and Tyler in their effort to investigate a mysterious murder case in an adventure packed with puzzles, beautiful locations, and dangerous characters, all provided in a retro fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mike &amp; Tyler is a point &amp; click - police adventure game heavily focused on puzzle-solving.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game skips text dialogs altogether, in favor of simple comic bubbles. No lengthy dialogs, here. This game is <strong>not </strong> an interactive story.</p>",
